{
  "name": "Secure Export",
  "description": "Restricts activities related to exporting data to specific IP address ranges, such as Secure Research Environments (SRE's). Provides several options to specify the types of projects, download activities to be restricted, and project level exceptions.",
  "documentation": "EM_SecureExport_ReadMe.pdf",
  "namespace": "JHU\\secureexport",
  "redcap-version-min": "14.0.2",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Michael Sherman Jr",
      "email": "mike.sherman@jhmi.edu",
      "institution": "Johns Hopkins University"
    },
    {
      "name": "Scott Carey",
      "email": "scarey@jhu.edu",
      "institution": "Johns Hopkins University"
    }
  ],
  "system-settings": [
    {
      "key": "separator-line1-sys",
      "name": "<hr style='height:5px;border-width:0;color:black;background-color:black'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;",
      "type": "descriptive"
    },
    {
      "key": "overview1-text",
      "name": "<b>Overview</b></br>There are several REDCap features that allow for the export of PHI/PII. This module allows REDCap Administrators to define SRE’s (using IP address ranges) and to control which REDCap features are to be restricted to those ranges.</br>When implemented, features related to restricted exports may be disabled on the user interface screens and hover-text (tooltip) information is displayed to the user. Additionally, certain pages display a message box containing more detailed information/instructions. Messaging is configurable within the EM Control Center settings.</br>To accommodate multi-site projects, where restricting “all” export locations is impractical, project level settings can be used to exempt additional IP ranges, Users, and/or DAG’s.</br></br><b>Considerations</b></br><ul><li>It is strongly recommended that changes to project level settings are limited to REDCap Administrators (in the control center module configuration).</li><li>•API Exports are not currently restricted through this module. API usage is best managed through institutional policy. API restrictions are being considered for a future update to this module. If you would like to share your thoughts on this issue, please reach out to Scott Carey (scarey@jhu.edu) and/or Mike Sherman (mike.sherman@jhmi.edu).</li></ul></br><b>Configuration</b></br>The Secure Export module has 7 Control Center EM settings:</br><ul><li>Exclude REDCap Administrators from Secure Export restrictions?</li><li>Approved IP address range(s)</li><li>Project Types to be restricted</li><li>Export Activities to be restricted</li><li>Access Control Group (ACG) exceptions</li><li>Alternate page banner messaging (optional)</li><li>Alternative hover text messaging (optional)</li></ul>",
      "type": "descriptive"
    },
    {
      "key": "separator-line2-sys",
      "name": "<hr style='height:5px;border-width:0;color:black;background-color:black'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;",
      "type": "descriptive"
    },
    {
      "key": "allow-super-users",
      "name": "<b>Exclude REDCap Administrators from Secure Export restrictions?</b>",
      "required": false,
      "type": "checkbox"
    },
    {
      "key": "ip-range-raw",
      "name": "<b>Secure Research Environment IP Address Range(s):</b></br><ul><li>Enter one IP address or range per line.</li><li><b>Example:</li></b><div style='margin-left: 10px; color: #800000;'><ul><li>192.168.1.0/24</li><li>10.0.0.50 - 10.0.0.150</li><li>172.16.5.10-172.16.5.30</li><li>8.8.8.8</li><li>203.0.113.0/255.255.255.128</li></ul></ul></div>",
      "type": "textarea"
    },
    {
      "key": "select-proj-types-sys",
      "name": "<b>Which project types should be restricted to an approved SRE?</b><br></li></ul>Unselected project types will NOT be restricted to SRE's</li></ul>",
      "type": "descriptive"
    },
    {
      "key": "proj-type-research-sys",
      "name": "&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Research",
      "type": "checkbox"
    },
    {
      "key": "proj-type-qi-sys",
      "name": "&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Quality Improvement",
      "type": "checkbox"
    },
    {
      "key": "proj-type-op-support-sys",
      "name": "&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Operational Support",
      "type": "checkbox"
    },
    {
      "key": "proj-type-practice-sys",
      "name": "&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Practice / Just for fun",
      "type": "checkbox"
    },
    {
      "key": "proj-type-other-sys",
      "name": "&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Other",
      "type": "checkbox"
    },
    {
      "key": "proj-type-none-sys",
      "name": "&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Project Type Not Indicated",
      "type": "checkbox"
    },
    {
      "key": "sre-select-restricted-features-sys",
